# Routes review requests automatically (§3.4). Combined with branch protection's
# "Require review from Code Owners", this is how the two-reviewer rule on
# sensitive paths is enforced rather than remembered.
#
# Later matches win, so put the broad rule first.

*                       @APPN/engineering

# Two owners = two required approvals on the paths that need them.
/src/identifiers/       @APPN/engineering @APPN/tech-leads
/src/auth/              @APPN/engineering @APPN/tech-leads
/migrations/            @APPN/engineering @APPN/data-engineering
/infrastructure/        @APPN/platform
/warehouse/models/      @APPN/data-engineering
/.github/workflows/     @APPN/platform
/SECURITY.md            @APPN/tech-leads
